abstract: >-
  A continuously-maintained, single-source-of-truth dataset of publicly
  disclosed GenAI and agentic-AI security incidents, vulnerabilities, and
  red-team findings. Every entry is mapped to OWASP Top 10 for LLM
  Applications (2025), OWASP Agentic Top 10 (ASI), NIST AI Risk Management
  Framework (AI 100-1), and MITRE ATLAS. Aggregated from AIID, OECD AIM,
  AIAAIC, MITRE ATLAS, AVID, MIT FutureTech AI Risk Navigator, NVD/GHSA/OSV,
  garak, promptfoo, and dozens of researcher blogs and vendor threat reports.
